stateDiagram-v2
    state "Dispatch in authored order" as Dispatch
    state "Abort siblings, keep first outcome" as Drain
    state "Return with no live builds" as Done
    [*] --> Dispatch
    Dispatch --> Dispatch: Slot available
    Dispatch --> Drain: Failure or Ctrl-C
    Dispatch --> Done: All succeeded and settled
    Drain --> Done: All builds settled
    Done --> [*]
